      "area": "Package products",
      "description": "Pure, host-testable modules (Packages/VisualCore): Math, Simulation (SceneClock, FixedStepClock, SeededRandom, AccessibilityPreferences), Scenes (PointerTracker, ExportGeometry), ShaderSource, EffectsGraph, Diagnostics (FramePacing), Parameters, Persistence, TestSupport (+ placeholder AudioDSP). iOS modules (Packages/VisualCoreRendering): Rendering, Effects, UI, Automation (Debug/measurement) (+ placeholder Audio). Rules R1-R5 enforced by scripts/check_dependencies.py.",
