      "area": "EGL render host and thread",
      "description": "RenderHost owns the EGL display/context/surfaces over ANGLE's Metal backend, a CAMetalLayer RenderView, a frame scheduler and context generations. All GL work runs on the main thread (@MainActor; dispatchPrecondition in DEBUG). pause/resume, recreateContext (context loss) and destroy; scenes implement RenderScene setup/resize/render/teardown.",
      "paths": [
        "Packages/VisualCoreRendering/Sources/VisualCoreRendering/RenderHost.swift",
        "Packages/VisualCoreRendering/Sources/VisualCoreRendering/RenderScene.swift",
